  "jei.siliconic.info.salt_dirt.discovery": "Salt dirt generates in deposits with a radius of 2–3 blocks along riverbeds and riverbanks in river biomes.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.salt_dirt.drops": "Mining it drops 2–4 salt, increased by Fortune. A shovel mines it quickly.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.salt.use": "Shapelessly combine 1 salt, 1 blaze powder, and 1 glass bottle to obtain 3 hydrogen chloride.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.magma_fuel": "Provides %s heat in the magma slot of hot front-end machines. Heat raises the machine to its target temperature and replaces operating losses.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.magma_fuel.lava": "Provides %s heat in the magma slot of hot front-end machines and leaves an empty bucket.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.arc_furnace.operation": "Reduces 4 quartz and 4 charcoal with a carbon electrode into 4 metallurgical-grade silicon and 2 silicon slag. Power draw changes between process phases.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.arc_furnace.electrode": "Loses 1 durability per batch. An electrode at least 75% worn produces 1 additional silicon slag.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.chlorination.pressure": "The reaction can finish with blocked outputs, but pressure then continues to rise. At the pressure limit, emergency venting destroys the inputs and products.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.distillation.purity": "Purity mode: processes 4 crude trichlorosilane for 20 seconds into 4 purified trichlorosilane.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.distillation.throughput": "Throughput mode: processes the same feed for 10 seconds into 3 purified trichlorosilane and 1 distillation residue. Change modes with the GUI button before starting a batch.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.distillation.stability": "Continuous operation builds stability and shortens purity-mode processing by up to 25%. Stability slowly falls while idle.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.distillation.residue": "Produced by the distillation tower in throughput mode. A chlorosilane recycler recovers it as 1 crude trichlorosilane.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.siemens.filament": "The quartz deposition filament is a catalyst for high-purity silicon deposition and is retained after a normal batch.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.siemens.recovery": "Press Recover in the GUI during operation to stop the current batch and recover a partial polysilicon rod. The loaded inputs are consumed.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.siemens.partial_rod": "Obtained by interrupting a Siemens reactor batch. Reprocess it with 2 purified trichlorosilane to recover high-purity polysilicon.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.recycler.loop": "Returns silicon tetrachloride and hydrogen to crude trichlorosilane and hydrogen chloride, circulating chlorinated reagents. Distillation residue is also recoverable as crude trichlorosilane.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.recycler.outputs": "Blue GUI output slots accept crude trichlorosilane, yellow slots accept hydrogen chloride, and the purple slot accepts other byproducts.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.wafer_assembler.contamination": "Each cell click in a normal wafer assembler has a (100 - cleanliness) / 2% chance to contaminate that cell permanently. Contaminated cells cannot be used. Creative assemblers are exempt.",
  "jei.siliconic.info.wafer_inverter.contamination": "When inversion finishes, cleanliness can replace the result with a contaminated wafer. The contamination chance increases by 2% for each missing cleanliness point.",
